"The platform is like a global auction house full of desperate people."
"It is reached with a hand on a crystal trading table while accessing the System."
"Listings sort by soonest ending and by rank; other ranks show view-only."
"Listings show location, and the System renders every offer in perfect English."
"Trader IDs are random, a rank letter and a number such as B13."
"Trades are private by default, and a trader may hide their identity."
"A listing gives ID, location, class trading, classes wanted, notes and autotrade setting."
"A listing greys out after a trade and must be updated and reactivated."
"Money bonuses are offered in notes and made legally binding outside the platform."
"A location plus a teen trading during school hours can reveal who a trader is."
"One February it held three S-ranks, fifteen A-ranks and a couple thousand C-ranks."
"A Beijing C-rank offered half a million dollars to trade Speedster Brute for Mind Healer."
